'''Tiny Ancient Hunt''' (原始のちび戦士, ''Genshi no Chibi Senshi'', '''Primitive Chibi Warrior''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

